{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06590","headline":"秋次霸亭寄申大 · 储光羲","name":"秋次霸亭寄申大","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"橘柚植寒陵，芙蓉蔕修坂。\n无言不得意，得意何由展。\n况我行且徒，而君往犹蹇。\n既伤人事近，复言天道远。\n薄暮入空亭，中夜不能饭。\n南听鸿雁尽，西见招摇转。\n千门汉主宫，百里周王苑。\n杲杲初景出，油油鲜云卷。\n会朝幸岁正，校猎从新猕。\n念君久京国，双涕如露泫。\n无人荐子云，太息竟谁辨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}